1
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:37,960
Look, that is the Ziwei Star.

2
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:39,700
The Ziwei Star.

3
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,920
With the Ziwei Star as my witness,

4
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:45,200
in this life,

5
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,020
I will only love Bai Li.

6
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:48,760
My head

7
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,100
hurts so much.

8
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:55,530
My wife, what's wrong? My wife!

9
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:57,760
My head hurts so much.

10
00:00:58,230 --> 00:00:59,860
You haven't fully recovered.

11
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:02,230
I was so stupid to watch the stars with you at night.

12
00:01:02,230 --> 00:01:02,900
Damn me.

13
00:01:11,860 --> 00:01:12,320
My wife,

14
00:01:13,230 --> 00:01:13,960
are you cold?

15
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:19,360
Bai Li.

16
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:20,830
What's going on?

17
00:01:20,930 --> 00:01:21,930
Why are you so hot?

18
00:01:32,930 --> 00:01:34,030
Please be okay.

19
00:01:34,729 --> 00:01:36,460
It wasn't easy for me to get you.

20
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:46,530
Zhaohan,

21
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:48,300
don't go.

22
00:02:00,460 --> 00:02:01,790
Stop calling that name.

23
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:03,900
Your man is Cang Yuan.

24
00:02:04,630 --> 00:02:05,490
Remember that.

25
00:02:22,130 --> 00:02:25,060
I've spent all my spiritual power on you, my wife.

26
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:29,460
I saved your life.

27
00:02:30,230 --> 00:02:32,690
If you don't give me a kiss when you wake up...

28
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,200
Forget it.

29
00:02:36,130 --> 00:02:38,260
You can pay me back slowly in this life.

30
00:03:20,900 --> 00:03:23,760
Are you burning the house down early in the morning?

31
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:24,220
My wife,

32
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:25,500
you're awake.

33
00:03:25,730 --> 00:03:27,100
I'm making porridge for you.

34
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:28,300
Look, rice porridge.

35
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,030
I specially stole half a bag of rice from the next mountain.

36
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:32,860
I promise it tastes better than yesterday's medicine.

37
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:33,730
Your porridge

38
00:03:34,730 --> 00:03:35,600
is glowing.

39
00:03:36,060 --> 00:03:37,660
That means it's nutritious.

40
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:38,900
Drink it,

41
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:42,020
and you'll walk with a spring in your step today.

42
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:46,930
Alright.

43
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:47,690
Let me do it.

44
00:03:49,130 --> 00:03:50,460
Bai Li is cooking for me.

45
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:52,760
She really does care about me.

46
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:56,700
This means we've entered the old married couple mode.

47
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:57,860
In a few days,

48
00:03:58,130 --> 00:04:01,060
should I start calling her the mother of my children?

49
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:03,400
If you keep giggling,

50
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:06,500
you can drink this whole pot of porridge yourself.

51
00:04:08,230 --> 00:04:09,230
I'm not laughing.

52
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:12,300
I'm seriously observing my wife's cooking skills.

53
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:14,700
I'll write a 3,000-word reflection later.

54
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:16,560
Take it over.

55
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,160
We'll head out after eating.

56
00:04:19,100 --> 00:04:20,600
Head out? Where to?

57
00:04:22,230 --> 00:04:23,100
Didn't you say

58
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:25,700
you were going to take me to the mortal market to see the world?

59
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:27,700
We almost burned to death at home last night.

60
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:30,130
We have to go out and find some proper food today.

61
00:04:30,130 --> 00:04:30,930
And by the way,

62
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:33,560
see how true those stories of yours really are.

63
00:04:34,900 --> 00:04:36,700
You're willing to go out with me?

64
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:38,560
Great!

65
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:43,820
I will definitely let you eat through half the streets of the mortal realm today.

66
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,200
What's wrong?

67
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,300
Nothing.

68
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:50,120
My legs are numb from squatting too long.

69
00:05:08,930 --> 00:05:11,330
Where is the osmanthus cake you mentioned?

70
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,490
It's just around the corner ahead.

71
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,330
Don't walk so fast, my wife.

72
00:05:15,530 --> 00:05:17,530
My body can't keep up with your pace.

73
00:05:18,960 --> 00:05:21,560
Didn't you brag about having an indestructible body?

74
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,930
Indestructible refers to the spiritual level.

75
00:05:23,930 --> 00:05:25,330
As for the physical body,

76
00:05:25,530 --> 00:05:27,460
it occasionally needs some sugar.

77
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:41,860
It looks exactly like you when you're angry.

78
00:05:51,060 --> 00:05:51,590
I like it.

79
00:05:52,030 --> 00:05:52,360
Boss.

80
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:53,790
How much is this?

81
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:55,159
Five copper coins.

82
00:05:56,830 --> 00:05:57,290
My lady.

83
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,600
Can you lend me four copper coins?

84
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,460
I'm four short.

85
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:04,700
You owe me five coins.

86
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,760
I'll just owe you.

87
00:06:07,030 --> 00:06:09,360
I'll pay you back slowly over my lifetime.

88
00:06:21,730 --> 00:06:22,860
Get out of the way!

89
00:06:23,230 --> 00:06:24,560
That beast has gone mad!

90
00:06:24,930 --> 00:06:26,200
I can't hold it!
